  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "ded31a70-d5e9-4952-b7e5-c1553304b37c",
    "name": "Generator Recall API",
    "description": "The Generator Recall API is used by generators to send information about recall times into the Generator Recall web-based interface in the EMMS Markets Portal. The system will then transfer the information to a central AEMO database for viewing and reporting by AEMO operators.\n\nFor details on how to get access and business rules for this API:",
